{"_t":"finding","entity":"ArcGIS Online sharing/rest/search generalized discovery method","field":"access","value":"https://www.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/search?q=<hebrew term>&f=json&num=20 ; also owner:<handle> and orgid:<id> qualifiers; item detail via /sharing/rest/content/items/<id>?f=json; org resolve via /sharing/rest/portals/<orgId>?f=json (often 403 anonymous - use item.orgId plus tags/city-name tag instead)","source_key":"arcgis.com/sharing/rest/search:generalized-method"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"ArcGIS Online sharing/rest/search generalized discovery method","field":"auth","value":"none - fully anonymous JSON search API","source_key":"arcgis.com/sharing/rest/search:generalized-method"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"ArcGIS Online sharing/rest/search generalized discovery method","field":"enrichment_idea","value":"run q=sports-facility / park / public-garden / public-space / football / court per-term, dedupe by orgId, then for each new orgId fetch owner:<handle> to enumerate the FULL municipal layer catalog (parcels/gush-helka, schools, shelters) for cross-ref keys in one pass","source_key":"arcgis.com/sharing/rest/search:generalized-method"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"ArcGIS Online sharing/rest/search generalized discovery method","field":"reliability","value":"community/official hybrid - item metadata (city tags, orgId) is reliable when present, but many items have empty description/tags/orgId requiring cross-checks (item to orgId to other org items to tag city name)","source_key":"arcgis.com/sharing/rest/search:generalized-method"}
